  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Up the Wolves** (1 review): Before the first verse, the reviewer thinks they hear a drunk friend, not a fan, shout his love for John [3]\n- **Spent Gladiator 2** (1 other source): The recording has a small cut during this song [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Friend of the Devil**: back after 105 archived shows (2014 days); rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **Riches and Wonders**: back after 34 archived shows (880 days); rare: 7 archived performances [4]\n- **Downtown Seoul**: rare: 12 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2022-05-05** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 26 songs; 111 min [1]\n- **tmg2022-05-05.aud.mv88.flac24**: audience recording; 26 songs; 112 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Grateful Dead, Wolves, judicial, three fourths of the band returns, wrestling [1]\n- Reviewer's first live Mountain Goats show; they stood about four feet behind the mic [3]\n- Taper stood roughly four feet from the right speaker stack [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2022-05-05**: taped by me; transferred by me; source: SBD [Engineer: Brandon Eggleston] > PCM-A10 + CA-14 (healy onstage) > CA-Ugly 2 > PCM-A10 [1]\n- **tmg2022-05-05.aud.mv88.flac24**: taped by One Dozen Cats; source: MV88 > iPhone 8 > WAV (24/48) [2]. Also: Recorded with an MV88 into an iPhone 8 at 24/48 WAV, edited in REAPER, converted to FLAC [2]",
